# Chat backend for the production build.
#
# Without this, `npm run build` (and therefore `npm run deploy`) produces a
# bundle with no chat endpoint, so the portrait opens with no input box. Setting
# it here means every production build picks it up automatically — no env var to
# remember on the command line.
#
# Not a secret: the worker is a public endpoint that only accepts requests whose
# Origin is hydermohyuddin.com, and the API keys live in Cloudflare, not here.
REACT_APP_CHAT_ENDPOINT=https://hyder-chat.hmohyud.workers.dev
